issue-two-or-more-nav-elements-were-found-on-the-page-and-at-least-one-of-them-has-no-09bde3 = Plusieurs régions repères de navigation trouvées sans étiquettes distinctives
issue-two-or-more-nav-landmarks-share-the-same-accessible-name-e-g-both-labelled-main-f043a9 = Two or more <nav> landmarks share the same accessible name (e.g., both labelled "Main navigation"), so users cannot distinguish them in the landmarks list.
issue-two-or-more-banner-landmarks-on-the-page-share-the-same-accessible-name-so-scree-e54207 = Two or more banner landmarks on the page share the same accessible name, so screen reader users cannot distinguish between them in the landmarks list.
issue-two-or-more-complementary-landmarks-on-the-page-share-the-same-accessible-name-e-5890a2 = Two or more complementary landmarks on the page share the same accessible name. Each complementary region needs a unique label so users can tell them apart.
issue-two-or-more-contentinfo-footer-landmarks-on-the-page-share-the-same-accessible-n-2770d8 = Two or more contentinfo (footer) landmarks on the page share the same accessible name, making them indistinguishable in the landmarks list.
issue-two-or-more-form-landmarks-on-the-page-share-the-same-accessible-name-so-users-c-279ce9 = Two or more form landmarks on the page share the same accessible name, so users cannot tell from the landmarks list which form is which.
issue-two-or-more-region-landmarks-on-the-page-share-the-same-accessible-name-so-they-9831c6 = Two or more region landmarks on the page share the same accessible name, so they cannot be told apart in the landmarks list.
issue-two-or-more-search-landmarks-share-the-same-accessible-name-if-multiple-search-a-c5cafb = Two or more search landmarks share the same accessible name. If multiple search areas exist, each needs a unique label (e.g., "Site search", "Product search").
issue-visual-ai-analysis-flagged-this-element-as-a-likely-accessibility-problem-but-th-6030fb = L'analyse visuelle par IA a signalé cet élément comme un probable problème d'accessibilité, mais le mode de défaillance précis n'a pas pu être rattaché à l'un des types d'issues répertoriés. La capture d'écran et le contexte de l'élément sont conservés dans le rapport afin que vous puissiez déterminer quel critère WCAG s'applique.
issue-visual-analysis-identified-a-modal-style-overlay-but-the-container-element-has-n-a0dd31 = Visual analysis identified a modal-style overlay, but the container element has no role="dialog" or role="alertdialog" attribute.
issue-when-the-element-receives-keyboard-focus-no-visible-change-occurs-no-outline-bor-9cede7 = When the element receives keyboard focus, no visible change occurs — no outline, border, background-colour, or box-shadow is applied.
issue-while-the-modal-is-open-tab-shift-tab-can-move-focus-to-elements-outside-the-dia-e98aaa = While the modal is open, Tab/Shift+Tab can move focus to elements outside the dialog instead of cycling through controls inside it.
issue-role-menu-or-role-menuitem-is-used-on-plain-navigation-links-the-menu-role-patte-2bb0af = Rôle menu utilisé de manière inappropriée pour des liens de navigation

# Regenerated by scripts/regenerate_inline_issue_ids.py — entries
